(70,'Workplace Safety','medium','terminated',1005,1006,'Cheska Bautista',NULL,'2026-10-25',NULL,'Campus Facilities Area','Obstructed Emergency Exit Route in the Facilities Area - 20261025144012-5','A facilities report identifies stored materials obstructing an emergency exit route and requests a safety inspection and corrective action.',1033,'Phil Vincent Lope',NULL,'2026-10-25 22:40:12','2026-10-26 09:07:57','My dad is the ceo of fortnite you cant fire me he will ban your fortnite account','2026-10-26 09:05:40','Wala na po ako makaen mamser','rejected','2026-10-26 09:06:22',NULL,'2026-10-26 09:07:23','njkdfkdkiefki'),
(71,'Workplace Conduct','medium','closed',1001,1002,'Jhon Carlo Garcia',NULL,'2026-10-25',NULL,'Administration Office','Repeated Interruptions During Departmental Meetings - 20261025144813-1','A staff report describes repeated interruptions during departmental meetings and requests an HR review under the workplace conduct policy.',1005,'Cheska Jalotjot Bautista',NULL,'2026-10-25 22:48:13','2026-10-26 00:04:05','Letter of Explanation\r\nDear Russel Gohetia Cabrido,\r\n\r\nYou are requested to submit your explanation concerning complaint reference CMP-00071.\r\n\r\nPlease use the secure link below to submit your response. The link expires in three days and can be used once.\r\n\r\nSubmit Letter of Explanation\r\n\r\nIf you believe you received this message in error or need assistance, please contact Human Resources.\r\n\r\nHuman Resources\r\nBestlink College of the Philippines','2026-10-25 23:56:25','This is to formally notify you that the management has rendered a Termination Recommendation in connection with Case CMP-00071 dated October 26, 2026.\r\n\r\nBased on the findings of the investigation and your disciplinary history, the company has decided to recommend the termination of your employment. You are required to submit a letter of intent regarding this decision within three (3) calendar days from receipt of this notice.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact the Human Resources Department.\r\n\r\nLETTER OF INTENT RESPONSE\r\nPlease submit your Letter of Intent within three (3) calendar days using this secure link:\r\nhttps://legal.bcp-hrms.com/modules/compliance/public/termination-loi.php?token=4c33bc7bbfcb9d1d3f39c337d205e0386424cbd2a8696920497188ee2806ec3d\r\nThis link expires three calendar days after issuance and may be used only once.','considered','2026-10-26 00:00:27',NULL,'2026-10-26 00:00:58',NULL),
(72,'Attendance Concern','low','terminated',1002,1003,'Russel Cabrido',NULL,'2026-10-25',NULL,'Faculty Office','Unverified Late Arrivals in the Attendance Register - 20261025144813-2','The department has reported discrepancies between recorded arrival times and the attendance register and requests verification against the official timekeeping records.',1005,'Cheska Jalotjot Bautista',NULL,'2026-10-25 22:48:13','2026-10-26 00:06:30','Dear Jose Mari Rich Malana,\r\n\r\nYou are requested to submit your explanation concerning complaint reference CMP-00072.\r\n\r\nPlease use the secure link below to submit your response. The link expires in three days and can be used once.\r\n\r\nSubmit Letter of Explanation\r\n\r\nIf you believe you received this message in error or need assistance, please contact Human Resources.\r\n\r\nHuman Resources\r\nBestlink College of the Philippines','2026-10-26 00:05:38','Dear Jose Mari Rich Malana,\r\n\r\nYou are requested to submit your explanation concerning complaint reference CMP-00072.\r\n\r\nPlease use the secure link below to submit your response. The link expires in three days and can be used once.\r\n\r\nSubmit Letter of Explanation\r\n\r\nIf you believe you received this message in error or need assistance, please contact Human Resources.\r\n\r\nHuman Resources\r\nBestlink College of the Philippines','rejected','2026-10-26 00:05:44',NULL,'2026-10-26 00:06:09',NULL),
(73,'Policy Compliance','medium','terminated',1003,1004,'Jose Mari Rich Malana',NULL,'2026-10-25',NULL,'Main Campus','Outstanding Acknowledgements of the Updated Workplace Policy - 20261025144813-3','A department has reported outstanding employee acknowledgements for the updated workplace conduct policy and requests confirmation of the pending records.',1005,'Cheska Jalotjot Bautista',NULL,'2026-10-25 22:48:13','2026-10-26 00:15:36','Dear Russell Placer,\r\n\r\nYou are requested to submit your explanation concerning complaint reference CMP-00073.\r\n\r\nPlease use the secure link below to submit your response. The link expires in three days and can be used once.\r\n\r\nSubmit Letter of Explanation\r\n\r\nIf you believe you received this message in error or need assistance, please contact Human Resources.\r\n\r\nHuman Resources\r\nBestlink College of the Philippines','2026-10-26 00:14:05','Dear Russell Placer,\r\n\r\nYou are requested to submit your explanation concerning complaint reference CMP-00073.\r\n\r\nPlease use the secure link below to submit your response. The link expires in three days and can be used once.\r\n\r\nSubmit Letter of Explanation\r\n\r\nIf you believe you received this message in error or need assistance, please contact Human Resources.\r\n\r\nHuman Resources\r\nBestlink College of the Philippines','rejected','2026-10-26 00:14:40',NULL,'2026-10-26 00:15:08','Dear Russell Placer,\n\nYou are requested to submit your explanation concerning complaint reference CMP-00073.\n\nPlease use the secure link below to submit your response. The link expires in three days and can be used once.\n\nSubmit Letter of Explanation\n\nIf you believe you received this message in error or need assistance, please contact Human Resources.\n\nHuman Resources\nBestlink College of the Philippines'),
